{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026e8qcZ2V0Dz1785814375.jpeg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳一段車 Cam 影片，顯示一輛車輛沿英皇道行駛至一交通燈位時，行車道旁的電車站突然有一名小童衝紅燈跑出馬路。幸司機及時扭軚，避過一場意外。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-04-10h42m39s282.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026imlMZ7tTw31785812662.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-04-10h42m39s282.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據影片顯示，事發時前方交通燈號亮起綠燈，車 Cam 車主正駕駛車輛通過燈位。當駛至行車道旁的電車站對開時，一名小童突然衝紅燈跑出馬路。司機見狀及時煞停車輛，未有釀成交通意外。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-04-10h37m30s769.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026OzxQSBb2dk1785812656.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-04-10h37m30s769.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">上載影片的網民在社交平台發文呼籲：「有無人可以幫手認領一下這位小朋友？」片段曝光後隨即引發網絡熱議。不少網民表示幸好沒有造成嚴重意外，並提醒駕駛者駛經燈位時須特別留意路面情況：「～幸得司機眼明手快～專心路上交通～否則小朋友必定有危險呀」、「好彩冇咩事」此外，亦有網民質疑同行家長未有看緊小童，留言：「家長責任最大」、「家長去咗邊？」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T03:40:09.319662+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}